sequenceDiagram
  participant SIG as SIG / source system
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant API as Node.js API
  participant MAP as JDBCAdapter + mapper/hasher
  participant GW as RoleGatewayClient(writer)
  participant CC as Fabric peer / chaincode

  SIG->>PG: Store operational transaction or audit log
  Note over PG: Existing business data; no test writes were made
  API->>MAP: POST /api/v1/ingest (API key)
  MAP->>PG: Select unindexed source rows
  PG-->>MAP: Raw source row
  MAP->>MAP: Normalize, validate, canonicalize payload\nSHA-256 of raw source row
  MAP->>GW: createAttestedEvent(eventId, eventType,\npayloadJson, sourceHash)
  GW->>CC: Endorse, order and submit as writer identity
  CC->>CC: Check Org1MSP + role=sfd_writer;\nstore payload and hashes
  CC-->>GW: Commit status, txId, result
  GW-->>MAP: Successful commit
  MAP->>PG: Insert mw.attested_index correlation
  Note over PG,CC: Fabric commit and PostgreSQL insert are not atomic;\nPostgreSQL failure can leave an unindexed ledger event
